  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "While Fang Zheng climbs toward the peak in the contest for Hu Immortal blessed land, an onlooker watching from outside speaks of a rank six exquisite warp Gu as their own. The remark follows the congratulations offered to He Feng Yang on Immortal Crane Sect’s showing, and it treats the Gu as no longer around. It trails off, and the next line from the watchers says that maybe with star shuttle Gu, fixed immortal travel Gu or one’s own movement Gu the results would differ.",
